objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.61 NAME 'ciamAttributeProfile' DESC '
 How one attribute is used in the user data: holders, most values, largest v
 alue' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamLdapName $ ciamHolderCount 
 ) MAY ( ciamMostValues $ ciamLargestValueBytes $ ciamProfiledAttribute ) X-
 ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.62 NAME 'ciamAlertRule' DESC 'What th
 e platform is watched for: a signal on a server role, the condition that fi
 res, how severe, who it goes to, what to do' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST
  ( cn $ ciamSignal $ ciamAlertRole ) MAY ( ciamTargetRole $ ciamComparison 
 $ ciamThreshold $ ciamEvaluationPeriod $ ciamSeverity $ ciamRunbookRef ) X-
 ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.63 NAME 'ciamLogRoute' DESC 'Where a 
 server role\27s logs go and how long they must be kept (an obligation: audi
 t logs survive a move and the source\27s decommissioning)' SUP ciamObject S
 TRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamLogKind $ ciamLogDestinationRole ) MAY ( ciamPubl
 ishedBy $ ciamRetentionDays $ ciamLegalHold ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.64 NAME 'ciamCanary' DESC 'A syntheti
 c check that signs in as a user would: what it exercises, how often, the se
 cret role of its test credentials, the alert it fires' SUP ciamObject STRUC
 TURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamCheckedService $ ciamCanaryFlow ) MAY ( ciamInterval 
 $ ciamUsesRole $ ciamFeedsAlert ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.65 NAME 'ciamAlertChannel' DESC 'What
  delivers alerts of a role in an environment (a topic, an action group, a p
 aging service)' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamChannelKind MAY ciamPro
 viderRef X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.66 NAME 'ciamLogDestination' DESC 'Wh
 at keeps logs of a role in an environment, and for how many days (0: kept i
 ndefinitely)' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamDestinationKind MAY ( cia
 mProviderRef $ ciamRetentionDays ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.67 NAME 'ciamAlarmBinding' DESC 'An a
 larm a cloud runs in an environment: the alert rule it realizes, what it ev
 aluates, what it notifies' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamProviderRef 
 MAY ( ciamRealizes $ ciamNotifies $ ciamMetric ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.68 NAME 'ciamCanaryBinding' DESC 'A s
 ynthetic check a cloud runs in an environment: the canary it realizes, how 
 often' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamProviderRef MAY ( ciamRealizes $
  ciamInterval ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.69 NAME 'ciamPermissionSet' DESC 'Wha
 t may be done, as verbs on binding roles: the same set means each environme
 nt\27s own resources' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamPermits ) X
 -ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.70 NAME 'ciamPrincipal' DESC 'Who or 
 what acts on the platform: the binding role of the identity each environmen
 t gives it, the permission sets it holds, the server role that runs as it, 
 its conditions and reviews; a break-glass account\27s credential role, proc
 edure and last test' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamPrincipalKin
 d $ ciamIdentityRole ) MAY ( ciamHoldsSet $ ciamTargetRole $ ciamCondition 
 $ ciamReviewedOn $ ciamReviewIntervalDays $ ciamUsesRole $ ciamRunbookRef $
  ciamLastTested ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.71 NAME 'ciamIdentityBinding' DESC 'T
 he cloud identity a principal acts as in an environment, what the cloud gra
 nts it and who may act as it' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamProviderR
 ef MAY ( ciamIdentityKind $ ciamGrant $ ciamTrustedBy $ ciamDenial $ ciamBo
 undary $ ciamEvaluated $ ciamIdentityClientId ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.72 NAME 'ciamGuardrail' DESC 'An orga
 nization guardrail over an environment and what it prevents (kept by the la
 nding zone)' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamGuardrailKind MAY ( ciamPr
 oviderRef $ ciamDenies $ ciamDenial $ ciamBoundary ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.73 NAME 'ciamAccessPath' DESC 'How op
 erators come into an environment: single sign-on, a session manager, a bast
 ion, a proxy, just-in-time elevation' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamA
 ccessKind MAY ( ciamProviderRef $ ciamTrustedBy $ ciamGrant ) X-ORIGIN 'ops
 dir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.74 NAME 'ciamTrafficPolicy' DESC 'How
  traffic reaches the servers behind service names: TLS handling and level, 
 health checks, stickiness, timeouts' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ 
 ciamServiceRole $ ciamTlsMode ) MAY ( ciamTlsMinVersion $ ciamTlsProfile $ 
 ciamBackendValidation $ ciamHealthProtocol $ ciamHealthPath $ ciamHealthInt
 ervalSeconds $ ciamHealthyThreshold $ ciamUnhealthyThreshold $ ciamStickine
 ss $ ciamStickinessSeconds $ ciamIdleTimeoutSeconds $ ciamDrainSeconds $ ci
 amEndpointPath ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.75 NAME 'ciamProtectionPolicy' DESC '
 What protects service names: web application firewall rules and rate limits
 , address and country rules, DDoS protection, a CDN' SUP ciamObject STRUCTU
 RAL MUST ( cn $ ciamServiceRole ) MAY ( ciamWafMode $ ciamWafCategory $ cia
 mRateLimit $ ciamIpRule $ ciamGeoRule $ ciamWafExclusion $ ciamDdosTier $ c
 iamCdn $ ciamEndpointPath ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.76 NAME 'ciamHeaderContract' DESC 'A 
 header someone sets and applications or products trust: header-based sign-o
 n, the client address behind a proxy' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $
  ciamHeaderName $ ciamHeaderKind $ ciamSetByRole ) MAY ( ciamTrustedByRole 
 $ ciamTrustedByConsumer $ ciamHeaderValue $ ciamStripsInbound ) X-ORIGIN 'o
 psdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.77 NAME 'ciamDnsZoneBinding' DESC 'A 
 DNS zone the environment publishes in, and who runs it when not the platfor
 m' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ( ciamDnsZone $ ciamZoneVisibility ) MAY
  ( ciamProviderRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.78 NAME 'ciamDnsRecord' DESC 'A DNS r
 ecord beyond the service names (verification, mail, delegation), with its T
 TL and routing' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ( ciamRecordName $ ciamReco
 rdType ) MAY ( ciamRecordValue $ ciamTtlSeconds $ ciamRoutingPolicy $ ciamR
 outingWeight $ ciamDnsZone $ ciamProviderRef ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.79 NAME 'ciamDnsForwarder' DESC 'A co
 nditional forwarder or resolver rule: the domains it forwards and the resol
 vers it forwards to' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ( ciamForwardDomain $ 
 ciamForwardTarget ) MAY ( ciamForwardDirection $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamReso
 lverHost ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.80 NAME 'ciamEdgeService' DESC 'A web
  application firewall, CDN, DDoS protection, API gateway or reverse proxy i
 n front of service names, and what it runs' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST
  ciamEdgeKind MAY ( ciamServiceRole $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamEdgeFact $ ciam
 EdgeSetting ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.82 NAME 'ciamEgressDestination' DESC 
 'An outside site the platform must reach (partner metadata, signing keys, c
 ertificate status, vendors)' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamDest
 ination $ ciamSiteKind ) MAY ( ciamNeededByRole $ ciamPort ) X-ORIGIN 'opsd
 ir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.83 NAME 'ciamRouteTable' DESC 'Routes
 , and the subnets that use them' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamRoute 
 MAY ( ciamSubnetRole $ ciamMainTable $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.84 NAME 'ciamNetworkAcl' DESC 'A stat
 eless network ACL on subnets: rules both ways, in number order' SUP ciamBin
 ding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamAclRule MAY ( ciamSubnetRole $ ciamEphemeralPorts 
 $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.85 NAME 'ciamPrivateEndpoint' DESC 'A
  private way to a service the platform uses, so its traffic stays off the i
 nternet' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamPrivateService MAY ( ciamPriva
 teEndpointKind $ ciamReachesRole $ ciamSubnetRole $ ciamFrontendIp $ ciamCi
 dr $ ciamDnsZone $ ciamDnsZoneRef $ ciamPrivateDns $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIG
 IN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.86 NAME 'ciamEndpointService' DESC 'A
  service name exposed privately to other networks or accounts, and who may 
 connect' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamServiceRole MAY ( ciamServiceA
 lias $ ciamAllowedPrincipal $ ciamAllowsConsumer $ ciamAcceptanceRequired $
  ciamVisibleTo $ ciamSubnetRole ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.87 NAME 'ciamProxy' DESC 'What egress
  to named sites passes, and the sites it allows' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL
  MUST ciamProxyKind MAY ( ciamProxyAddress $ ciamAllowedDestination $ ciamM
 anagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.88 NAME 'ciamTimeSource' DESC 'Where 
 the servers get their time (clock skew breaks SAML and replication)' SUP ci
 amBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamTimeServer MAY ciamTimeKind X-ORIGIN 'opsdir'
  )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.89 NAME 'ciamFlowLog' DESC 'A flow lo
 g: what it records, where it goes, how long it is kept' SUP ciamBinding STR
 UCTURAL MUST ciamFlowScope MAY ( ciamSubnetRole $ ciamLogDestinationRole $ 
 ciamRetentionDays $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.90 NAME 'ciamFirewallPolicy' DESC 'A 
 firewall policy attached to the network or above it; rules name it by its r
 ole' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamPolicyScope MAY ( ciamPolicyOrder 
 $ ciamTagKeyRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.91 NAME 'ciamImportRun' DESC 'The las
 t import by one importer of one environment (or of what environments share)
 : when the live system was read back, what it read and under which change (
 ciamChangeRef), and when opsdir collected the export itself, how (the ident
 ity the provider saw, each call and the hash of what it returned, the crede
 ntial references used); what a fix that needs a fresh read checks' SUP ciam
 Object STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamImporter $ ciamImportScope $ ciamImported
 At ) MAY ( ciamCollectionIdentity $ ciamCollectedCall $ ciamCollectionCrede
 ntial ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.92 NAME 'ciamExternalHost' DESC 'A sy
 stem the platform reaches but doesn\27t run (a database, a corporate direct
 ory), as this environment reaches it: its host name (and port); products na
 me its role, so each environment renders its own host. One host is the usua
 l case; a system reached at several (two domain controllers) is several bin
 dings of the role, in host order' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamFqdn 
 MAY ( ciamPort $ ciamManagedBy $ ciamHostOrder ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.93 NAME 'ciamDatabase' DESC 'A manage
 d database an environment runs for the stack (a repository, a session or to
 ken store): its engine and version, endpoint, availability, encryption and 
 backups (ciamRetentionDays: automated backups kept), parameters, the ranges
  admitted to its port (ciamSourceCidr) and the secret role of its credentia
 ls' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamDbEngine MAY ( ciamProviderRef $ ci
 amFqdn $ ciamPort $ ciamDbEngineVersion $ ciamDbEdition $ ciamDbService $ c
 iamInstanceSize $ ciamDbStorageGb $ ciamZone $ ciamDbHighAvailability $ cia
 mEncryptedByRole $ ciamDbTlsRequired $ ciamRetentionDays $ ciamDbPointInTim
 e $ ciamDbDeletionProtection $ ciamDbParameter $ ciamSubnetRole $ ciamSourc
 eCidr $ ciamDbCredentialRole $ ciamCopyRegion $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'o
 psdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.94 NAME 'ciamVolume' DESC 'A disk eve
 ry server of a role (ciamTargetRole) has in an environment, its compute gro
 ups\27 included: its boot disk or a data volume, how big and fast it is, it
 s encryption and the snapshot policy that copies it' SUP ciamBinding STRUCT
 URAL MUST ( ciamTargetRole $ ciamVolumeKind ) MAY ( ciamMountPath $ ciamVol
 umeSizeGb $ ciamVolumeClass $ ciamIops $ ciamThroughputMb $ ciamVolumeEncry
 pted $ ciamEncryptedByRole $ ciamSnapshotPolicyRole $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORI
 GIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.95 NAME 'ciamSnapshotPolicy' DESC 'Ho
 w an environment snapshots its disks: how often, when, how long each snapsh
 ot is kept (ciamRetentionDays) and the regions it is copied to' SUP ciamBin
 ding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamRetentionDays MAY ( ciamSnapshotEveryHours $ ciamS
 napshotAt $ ciamCopyRegion $ ciamSnapshotConsistency $ ciamProviderRef $ ci
 amManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.96 NAME 'ciamEstateSetting' DESC 'An 
 estate-wide setting the platform\27s managers give a value (under ou=settin
 gs, named as a domain declares it): where the record holds none, or one tha
 t isn\27t valid, the domain\27s default applies' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL 
 MUST ( cn $ ciamEstateValue ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.97 NAME 'ciamBackupVault' DESC 'Where
  a backup service keeps an environment\27s recovery points (an AWS Backup v
 ault, an Azure Backup vault, a Backup and DR vault): its key, its lock and 
 whether it can restore in another region. Not infrastructure\27s ciamBackup
 Target, the object store a product writes its own backup files to' SUP ciam
 Binding STRUCTURAL MAY ( ciamProviderRef $ ciamEncryptedByRole $ ciamStorag
 eImmutability $ ciamStorageLockDays $ ciamCrossRegionRestore $ ciamManagedB
 y ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.98 NAME 'ciamBackupPlan' DESC 'What a
  backup service backs up in an environment (the roles it protects), into wh
 ich vault, how often and from when, how long it keeps each recovery point (
 ciamRetentionDays) and the regions it copies them to' SUP ciamBinding STRUC
 TURAL MUST ( ciamProtectsRole $ ciamBackupVaultRole $ ciamRetentionDays ) M
 AY ( ciamBackupEveryHours $ ciamBackupAt $ ciamBackupWindowHours $ ciamCopy
 Region $ ciamRestoreTestDays $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN '
 opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.99 NAME 'ciamRestoreTest' DESC 'One r
 estore test (under ou=restore-tests): when, in which environment, whose dat
 a it restored and from what, what it proved (disk or application), how it w
 ent and how long it took' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamTestedO
 n $ ciamTestEnvironment $ ciamRestoredRole $ ciamRestoreLevel $ ciamTestRes
 ult ) MAY ( ciamRestoredFromRole $ ciamRestoreMinutes $ ciamRunbookRef ) X-
 ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.100 NAME 'ciamRecoveryObjective' DESC
  'A recovery objective (under ou=recovery): for the roles it names, how lon
 g what they serve may be down after a disaster (RTO), how much of what they
  hold may be lost (RPO) and the runbook that recovers them; every environme
 nt running them is held to it' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamRe
 coversRole ) MAY ( ciamRtoMinutes $ ciamRpoMinutes $ ciamRunbookRef ) X-ORI
 GIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.101 NAME 'ciamStandby' DESC 'Added to
  an environment that stands by for another: the environment it takes over f
 rom, how ready it is kept and the runbook that fails over to it' SUP top AU
 XILIARY MUST ciamStandbyOf MAY ( ciamStandbyMode $ ciamRunbookRef ) X-ORIGI
 N 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.102 NAME 'ciamFailoverDrill' DESC 'On
 e failover drill (under ou=failover-drills): when, from which environment t
 o which, the roles it verified (all when none is named), how it went, how l
 ong until service was back and how much was lost' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL
  MUST ( cn $ ciamDrilledOn $ ciamDrillFrom $ ciamDrillTo $ ciamDrillResult 
 ) MAY ( ciamServiceMinutes $ ciamDataLossMinutes $ ciamRecoversRole $ ciamR
 unbookRef ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.103 NAME 'ciamCloudAccount' DESC 'Add
 ed to a cloud: the account its environments run in, the organization above 
 it, the account its billing is managed from and the Terraform provider add-
 ons its roots may use' SUP top AUXILIARY MAY ( ciamAccountRef $ ciamOrganiz
 ationRef $ ciamBillingAccountRef $ ciamProviderAddOn ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.104 NAME 'ciamEnvironmentPlacement' D
 ESC 'Added to an environment: the resource group its resources go in (where
  the cloud has them), how sensitive its data is, the residency and reportin
 g obligations it is held to, the cloud authorization it relies on (the leve
 l it requires, the configurations it has in place)' SUP top AUXILIARY MAY (
  ciamResourceGroup $ ciamDataClassification $ ciamResidencyRef $ ciamReport
 ingObligationRef $ ciamAuthorizationRef $ ciamRequiredAuthorization $ ciamC
 onfigurationMet ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.105 NAME 'ciamChargedParty' DESC 'Add
 ed to a party: the cost center its spending is charged to' SUP top AUXILIAR
 Y MAY ciamCostCenter X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.106 NAME 'ciamTagRule' DESC 'One tag 
 of the estate\27s tag policy (under ou=tag-policy): its key and where its v
 alue comes from in each environment' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ 
 ciamTagKey $ ciamTagSource ) MAY ciamTagValue X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.107 NAME 'ciamRegionCatalog' DESC 'On
 e provider\27s regions (under ou=regions, named after the provider): its ci
 amCloudRegion entries' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamCloudProvi
 der ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.108 NAME 'ciamCloudRegion' DESC 'A re
 gion of a provider\27s catalog, named by the provider\27s region code (eu-w
 est-1, westeurope, europe-west1): its name, where it is, its status and par
 tition' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST cn MAY ( ciamRegionName $ ciamGeogra
 phy $ ciamRegionStatus $ ciamCloudEnvironment ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.109 NAME 'ciamResidency' DESC 'A resi
 dency the estate defines (under ou=residencies): where data held to it may 
 be, as the catalog regions it allows (any provider\27s)' SUP ciamObject STR
 UCTURAL MUST cn MAY ciamAllowedRegion X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.110 NAME 'ciamCloudEndpoints' DESC 'A
 dded to a cloud: how its clients reach the provider\27s APIs (FIPS 140 vali
 dated endpoints)' SUP top AUXILIARY MAY ciamFipsEndpoints X-ORIGIN 'opsdir'
  )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.111 NAME 'ciamAuditTrail' DESC 'An en
 vironment\27s control-plane audit trail (CloudTrail, the Activity Log\27s d
 iagnostic setting, Cloud Audit Logs\27 sinks): what it records, where its r
 ecords go (a log destination\27s or object store\27s role), and who keeps i
 t when it isn\27t the platform team (an organization trail the landing zone
  keeps)' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamAuditScope MAY ( ciamAuditEven
 ts $ ciamAllRegions $ ciamIntegrityValidation $ ciamLogDestinationRole $ ci
 amProviderRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.112 NAME 'ciamSecurityService' DESC '
 A cloud security service an environment runs (threat detection, vulnerabili
 ty scanning, configuration recording, posture assessment): what it watches 
 or assesses, one account or the whole organization, every region or one, wh
 ere its findings go (and those at or above a severity, to the incident proc
 ess), how long it keeps its records (ciamRetentionDays), and who keeps it w
 hen the platform team doesn\27t' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamSecuri
 tyKind MAY ( ciamSecurityCoverage $ ciamComplianceStandard $ ciamSecurityBa
 seline $ ciamAuditScope $ ciamAllRegions $ ciamFindingsRole $ ciamIncidentR
 ole $ ciamIncidentSeverity $ ciamRetentionDays $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamMana
 gedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.113 NAME 'ciamQuotaNeed' DESC 'What a
 n environment needs of a provider limit: a quota kind (or the provider\27s 
 own quota, ciamProviderRef) and how many; and, when the provider grants les
 s, the operator\27s decision' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamQuotaNeed
 ed MAY ( ciamQuotaKind $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamQuotaDecision $ ciamQuotaReq
 uested ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.114 NAME 'ciamBudget' DESC 'A budget 
 for an environment\27s spending: its amount per period, the shares of it (s
 pent or forecast) that alert the channel of its ciamAlertRole, and who keep
 s it when the platform team doesn\27t' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciam
 BudgetAmount MAY ( ciamCurrency $ ciamBudgetPeriod $ ciamActualThreshold $ 
 ciamForecastThreshold $ ciamAlertRole $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X
 -ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.115 NAME 'ciamQuotaCatalog' DESC 'The
  limits a provider grants one account in one region (under ou=quotas), as f
 etched: its ciamQuotaLimit entries' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ c
 iamCloudProvider $ ciamRegion ) MAY ciamAccountRef X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.116 NAME 'ciamQuotaLimit' DESC 'One l
 imit of a quota catalog, named by the provider\27s quota id: the value gran
 ted, its name, the usage when fetched and the quota kind it answers' SUP ci
 amObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamQuotaValue ) MAY ( ciamQuotaName $ ciam
 QuotaUsage $ ciamQuotaKind ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.117 NAME 'ciamReportingObligation' DE
 SC 'An incident reporting obligation the estate is held to (under ou=report
 ing-obligations, named by the regime\27s id: dfars-7012): the hours from di
 scovery to report, to the operator\27s own incident response and to the aut
 hority; who files and with which certificate; where malware goes; how long 
 evidence is preserved after a report (and the runbook placing the hold); th
 e contracts imposing it and the prime contractor a subcontractor reports to
 ' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamReportingHours ) MAY ( ciamInte
 rnalReportingHours $ ciamReportingAuthority $ ciamReportingParty $ ciamMalw
 areSubmission $ ciamPreservationDays $ ciamReportingCertificateRef $ ciamCo
 ntractNumber $ ciamPrimeParty $ ciamRunbookRef $ ciamDocUrl $ ciamRequiredA
 uthorization ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.118 NAME 'ciamReportingIdentity' DESC
  'Added to a party: what a reporting regime asks to identify it by (CAGE co
 de, Unique Entity ID)' SUP top AUXILIARY MAY ( ciamCageCode $ ciamUei ) X-O
 RIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.119 NAME 'ciamReportableIncident' DES
 C 'Added to an incident: what its reporting needs: the obligations it falls
  under (its own, else those of the environments it affected), when it was d
 iscovered and reported, the authority\27s report number, when the prime was
  told, malware submitted, until when its media are preserved and what the a
 uthority asked of them' SUP top AUXILIARY MAY ( ciamReportingObligationRef 
 $ ciamAffectedEnvironment $ ciamDiscoveredAt $ ciamReportedAt $ ciamReportR
 ef $ ciamPrimeNotifiedAt $ ciamMalwareSubmittedAt $ ciamMalwareRef $ ciamPr
 eservedUntil $ ciamMediaRequest ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.120 NAME 'ciamPoamItem' DESC 'A known
  weakness the operator plans to correct (under ou=poam): the controls it co
 ncerns, how and when it was found, when and how it will be corrected, its r
 isk, the environments it affects and what it is worth in its framework\27s 
 scoring' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamWeakness $ ciamPoamStatu
 s $ ciamAffectedEnvironment ) MAY ( ciamControlRef $ ciamDiscoverySource $ 
 ciamAssessmentRef $ ciamDiscoveredAt $ ciamScheduledCompletion $ ciamMilest
 one $ ciamRiskRating $ ciamVendorDependency $ ciamInvolved $ ciamFindingRef
  $ ciamEvidenceRef $ ciamLastReviewedAt $ ciamPointValue ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir
 ' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.121 NAME 'ciamRiskException' DESC 'An
  approved deviation (under ou=exceptions) for the environments it names, ne
 ver others: what it is, why, who may accept the risk and who approved it, u
 ntil when, and the controls, cloud findings and planner findings it covers'
  SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamExceptionKind $ ciamExceptionSta
 tus $ ciamAffectedEnvironment ) MAY ( ciamJustification $ ciamCompensatingC
 ontrol $ ciamRiskAuthority $ ciamApprovedBy $ ciamApprovedAt $ ciamExpiresA
 t $ ciamControlRef $ ciamFindingRef $ ciamAcceptsFinding $ ciamPoamRef $ ci
 amEvidenceRef $ ciamLastReviewedAt ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.122 NAME 'ciamComplianceAssessment' D
 ESC 'A compliance assessment of environments against a framework (under ou=
 assessments): who assessed, when, the score and the status it gave' SUP cia
 mObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamFramework $ ciamAssessmentKind $ ciamAss
 essedAt ) MAY ( ciamAssessmentScore $ ciamAssessmentMaxScore $ ciamAssessme
 ntStatus $ ciamAffectedEnvironment $ ciamFullScoreBy $ ciamAssessmentRef $ 
 ciamEvidenceRef ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.123 NAME 'ciamSuppression' DESC 'A cl
 oud\27s suppression of findings in an environment (archived, muted, exempte
 d), carrying out an exception: the findings it covers, until when; local to
  its environment\27s cloud (a target gets its own from its own exceptions)'
  SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MAY ( ciamFindingRef $ ciamExceptionRef $ ciamE
 xpiresAt $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.124 NAME 'ciamCloudAuthorization' DES
 C 'A cloud offering\27s authorization the estate relies on (under ou=author
 izations, named by its package id): the offering, its levels and status, th
 e services inside its boundary (imported from the provider\27s package over
 view, with where and when), its customer responsibility matrix and what cus
 tomers must configure' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamPackageId 
 ) MAY ( ciamOfferingName $ ciamProviderName $ ciamCloudProvider $ ciamCloud
 Environment $ ciamDeploymentModel $ ciamAuthorizationLevel $ ciamAuthorizat
 ionStatus $ ciamCertificationType $ ciamCertifiedAt $ ciamInScopeService $ 
 ciamScopeAsOf $ ciamSourceUrl $ ciamRetrievedAt $ ciamCrmRef $ ciamRequires
 Configuration $ ciamEvidenceRef $ ciamDocUrl ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.125 NAME 'ciamSystemBoundary' DESC 'T
 he operator\27s own system boundary (under ou=boundaries): the system secur
 ity plan it is documented in, the environments inside it and its authorizin
 g official' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST cn MAY ( ciamSspRef $ ciamAffect
 edEnvironment $ ciamRiskAuthority $ ciamDocUrl $ ciamEvidenceRef ) X-ORIGIN
  'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.126 NAME 'ciamControlResponsibility' 
 DESC 'Who meets a control under a cloud authorization (under ou=responsibil
 ities, from its customer responsibility matrix), what the customer must do 
 and how the operator does it (or the exception or POA&M item covering it)' 
 SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamAuthorizationRef $ ciamControlRef
  $ ciamResponsibility ) MAY ( ciamCustomerAction $ ciamImplementation $ cia
 mExceptionRef $ ciamPoamRef $ ciamEvidenceRef ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.127 NAME 'ciamDataDiscovery' DESC 'A 
 data discovery service an environment runs (Amazon Macie, Defender for Clou
 d\27s sensitive data discovery, Sensitive Data Protection): the stores it e
 xamines, the organization\27s own data types it looks for, how often, where
  its findings go and where it keeps its results' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL
  MAY ( ciamScansRole $ ciamCustomIdentifier $ ciamRescanDays $ ciamFindings
 Role $ ciamResultsRole $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamManagedBy ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir
 ' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.128 NAME 'ciamCollectionSource' DESC 
 'Where `opsdir collect` reads an environment for an importer that needs mor
 e than the operator\27s own cloud login: a Terraform state object, or a pro
 duct\27s admin endpoint (a URL, or the servers of a role on a port) with th
 e credential and trust anchor it is read with: the operator\27s opt-in' SUP
  ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamImporter MAY ( ciamSourceRef $ ciamTargetR
 ole $ ciamPort $ ciamCredentialRole $ ciamCaRole $ ciamLoginName ) X-ORIGIN
  'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.129 NAME 'ciamCollectionAttempt' DESC
  'The last attempt by `opsdir collect` to collect one importer\27s export o
 f one environment (or estate-wide), recorded under the change it ran with (
 ciamChangeRef) whatever the outcome: complete, or incomplete or skipped wit
 h its problems and the calls it made, so a failed collection stays visible 
 after the run' SUP ciamObject STRUCTURAL MUST ( cn $ ciamImporter $ ciamCol
 lectionOutcome $ ciamCollectedAt ) MAY ( ciamCollectedEnvironment $ ciamCol
 lectionProblem $ ciamCollectionIdentity $ ciamCollectedCall $ ciamCollectio
 nCredential ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.130 NAME 'ciamWorkloadBinding' DESC '
 How an environment runs a workload on Kubernetes (its role is the workload\
 27s ciamWorkloadRole): images, the product version they run, replicas, reso
 urces, storage' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MAY ( ciamContainerImage $ ciamW
 orkloadReplicas $ ciamCpuRequest $ ciamCpuLimit $ ciamMemoryRequest $ ciamM
 emoryLimit $ ciamStorageSize $ ciamStorageClass $ ciamProviderRef $ ciamPro
 ductVersion ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
objectClasses: ( 1.3.6.1.4.1.32473.1.2.131 NAME 'ciamSecretStore' DESC 'Wher
 e an environment\27s references of one scheme are read from, beyond what ea
 ch reference says: the store\27s address and how Kubernetes workloads log i
 n to it' SUP ciamBinding STRUCTURAL MUST ciamRefScheme MAY ( ciamStoreEndpo
 int $ ciamStoreAuthRole $ ciamStoreAuthMount $ ciamStoreKvVersion $ ciamPro
 viderRef ) X-ORIGIN 'opsdir' )
